# Hall of Echoes: 'The "legend rule" doesn't apply to permanents you control this turn' - its controller's, nobody
# else's. Bot1 has Bofur, Reliable Guardian, and Bot2 has its own. In Bot2's turn 4, after Bot2 plays a land, Bot1 pays
# {5} for the Hall at Bot1's Bofur: the Hall becomes a second Bofur and Bot1 keeps both. Bot2 then casts its second Bofur:
# the legend rule applies to Bot2 (CR 704.5j), who keeps one and puts the other into its graveyard, while Bot1's two
# stay until the end of the turn, when the Hall is a land again.

